WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Two decks and Sound FX stay in one workspace.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Bring either source forward with the crossfader.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Each deck has its own volume and queue.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Select a queued track to play it now. The queue follows.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Trigger a sound effect. Music lowers while the effect plays.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Stop fades the selected deck while the other keeps playing.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
DJMesrc keeps event audio simple for the whole team.
